# ── Secrets — never commit ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# config.json holds the Claude API key, Gmail app password, and staff password
# hashes. secret_key.txt signs Flask sessions. See config.example.json for shape.
config.json
config.json.bak*
secret_key.txt

# ── Live data (this folder IS production) ─────────────────────────────────────
intake.db
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
current_batch.json
*.log
STARTUP_LOG.txt

# ── Scanned documents / filed mail (financial docs, never in git) ─────────────
Backups/
Batch Covers/
Email Scans/
Filed/
Test Scans/
Unfiled Scans/
Bug Reports/
*.pdf
*.meta.json

# ── Bundled runtime & caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
python/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── Machine-specific binaries (2026-07-27 review, GH #11) ─────────────────────
# Windows shortcuts carry one desk's paths; the ScanSnap profile export lives on
# the share for Connect My Scanner.bat to open, but is a binary blob git can't
# meaningfully diff. Recreation steps are in SCANNER_SETUP.md.
*.lnk
*.sswp

# ── Local tool state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
